      "filename": "Captivating Image of Humayun's Tomb by Prajesh Majumdar's 2012 Masterpiece 03.jpg",
      "title": "File:Captivating Image of Humayun's Tomb by Prajesh Majumdar's 2012 Masterpiece 03.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/19/Captivating_Image_of_Humayun%27s_Tomb_by_Prajesh_Majumdar%27s_2012_Masterpiece_03.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Captivating_Image_of_Humayun%27s_Tomb_by_Prajesh_Majumdar%27s_2012_Masterpiece_03.jpg",
